## Non-Interactive Command Execution

**NEVER use interactive flags with npm commands:**

```bash
# ❌ WRONG
npm install --interactive

# ✅ CORRECT  
npm install

# ❌ WRONG
npx some-cli --interactive

# ✅ CORRECT
npx some-cli --yes  # Use non-interactive flag
```
